    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep It Lit is a Virtual Tabletop designed to enhance immersion while playing the ShadowDark roleplaying game.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torch Timers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple user interface for Players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated ShadowDark character sheets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import player characters from </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control of multiple tokens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat window</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated dice roller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online in multiplayer mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in-person with a flat-screen monitor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep It Lit is free for Players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the Keep It Lit DLC is required to host a session</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep It Lit is a Virtual Tabletop designed to enhance immersion while playing the ShadowDark roleplaying game.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torch Timers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple user interface for Players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated ShadowDark character sheets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import player characters from </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control of multiple tokens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat window</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated dice roller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online in multiplayer mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in-person with a flat-screen monitor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep It Lit is free for Players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the Keep It Lit DLC is required to host a session</p></li></ul>",
